Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 05:04:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1406/1463] HERESY 1451: the page's words without the voice and
 genre sliders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

After 1449 (Viktor 15.10.2026: «Нахер убирай это слайдерное говно из нашей Студии»): the profile's tip, Reuse, New song (its tip and its question), Clear (its toast, its question and its tip, which had no translation at all and has eleven now), the codes' note, the Models card's tip and its restart line no longer name sliders, in English and eleven languages; the datasheet's group is «LoRAs» unless an old take had sliders. The Shape card's sliders and an old prompt's «Slider … is not installed» keep their words. Kitchen suite 811/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
